// SendPingPongToXinu.abcl
// ------------------------------------------------------------------
// Mac-side AIPL orchestrator (OCaml AIPL runtime, repl_thread).
// It ships the PingPong actor program to a running Xinu kernel and
// starts it there WITHOUT recompiling the kernel:
//
//   xinu_loadvm(host, abcl_path)
//     1. reads + compiles abcl_path to a .avm bytecode module (Avm_gen)
//     2. POSTs it to  http://<host>/actor/loadvm  (the Xinu dynamic
//        actor loader), which spawns its first class as a live actor
//        and kicks it with tick()
//     3. returns the spawned actor id (or -1)
//
// PingPongVM.abcl is the VM-compatible PingPong (integer-only, no
// top-level globals) that the kernel bytecode VM can run.
// ------------------------------------------------------------------
var host = "192.168.3.50:8080";
var prog = "/Users/kodamay/ocaml-app/abclcp-project/abclc/PingPongVM.abcl";

print("[mac-aipl] sending PingPong.abcl to Xinu...");
var id = xinu_loadvm(host, prog);
print("[mac-aipl] Xinu spawned actor id:");
print(id);
print("[mac-aipl] done — watch the 'VM print' window on Xinu.");
